WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:02.200
What's up everybody!

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:05.680
We are Pongfinity and welcome to another episode of Challenge Pongfinity.

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:11.500
This is the series where YOU challenge US with your craziest ideas related to table tennis.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.380
If your idea gets picked, we'll feature it and give it a shoutout.

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:20.360
So make sure to leave your comments in the comments below!

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:27.320
So our good friend Benedek Olah has challenged us to the around the bottle challenge

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:31.160
Where you have to serve around the bottle placed on the other side of the table.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:51.120
Jack Green wants us to make a behind the back around the net shot from a through the legs around the net shot.

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:53.370
Shouldn't be hard. Let's do it!

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:14.500
Sebastian Edvardsson wants us to play with our wrong hand and do around the net shots.

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:17.060
So let's see who can do the most!

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:38.320
Devendra Kumar Jain wants us to play with two rackets.

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:22.820
Demirzhan Sabrii suggests, we should play with a hairdryer.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:22.080
The next challenge is down to you guys.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:25.540
Cody Zet wants us to get 3000 likes in this video.

00:03:25.780 --> 00:03:27.580
So make sure you give this video a like

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:49.360
Thanks for watching guys

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:52.340
If you're new to the channel subscribe here

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:54.540
And check out our other videos here.

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:59.860
